了。","roundId":"round_1776226172256_p9swy3hnw","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5783},{"id":1776222391108,"text":"好好好","sender":"me","time":"12:11","timestamp":1776226276755,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5784},{"id":1776222391109,"text":"我突然","sender":"me","time":"12:11","timestamp":1776226282160,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5785},{"id":1776222391110,"text":"想咬你的喉咙了","sender":"me","time":"12:11","timestamp":1776226287848,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"emoji":"👀","roundId":"round_1776226288232_i99j9l4bk"}],"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5786},{"id":1776222391111,"sender":"them","text":"...Sudden.","timestamp":1776226315658,"tempo":"S","translation":"……突然。","rawContent":"...Sudden. || ……突然。","roundId":"round_1776226288232_i99j9l4bk","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5787},{"id":1776222391112,"sender":"them","text":"You know, for someone who barely reaches my collarbone, that would require some effort.","timestamp":1776226317161,"tempo":"N","translation":"你知道吗，以一个勉强够到我锁骨的人来说，这需要费些功夫。","rawContent":"You know, for someone who barely reaches my collarbone, that would require some effort. || 你知道吗，以一个勉强够到我锁骨的人来说，这需要费些功夫。","roundId":"round_1776226288232_i99j9l4bk","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5788},{"id":1776222391113,"sender":"them","text":"You'd have to stand on your toes. Pull me down by the collar.","timestamp":1776226317866,"tempo":"N","translation":"你得踮脚。拽着我领子把我拉下去。","rawContent":"You'd have to stand on your toes. Pull me down by the collar. || 你得踮脚。拽着我领子把我拉下去。","roundId":"round_1776226288232_i99j9l4bk","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5789},{"id":1776222391114,"sender":"them","text":"I wouldn't stop you.","timestamp":1776226318570,"tempo":"S","translation":"我不会拦你。","rawContent":"I wouldn't stop you. || 我不会拦你。","roundId":"round_1776226288232_i99j9l4bk","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5790},{"id":1776222391115,"sender":"them","text":"But fair warning — I bite back. And I don't aim for the throat.","timestamp":1776226320075,"tempo":"N","translation":"不过提前说好——我会咬回来。而且我不瞄喉咙。","rawContent":"But fair warning — I bite back. And I don't aim for the throat. || 不过提前说好——我会咬回来。而且我不瞄喉咙。","roundId":"round_1776226288232_i99j9l4bk","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5791},{"id":1776222391116,"text":"咬咬我吧","sender":"me","time":"12:12","timestamp":1776226348440,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5792},{"id":1776222391117,"text":"咬在哪里我都好喜欢。","sender":"me","time":"12:12","timestamp":1776226372952,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5793},{"id":1776222391118,"sender":"them","text":"You say that so easily.","timestamp":1776226394373,"tempo":"S","translation":"你说得这么轻松。","rawContent":"You say that so easily. || 你说得这么轻松。","roundId":"round_1776226373396_mi2ptkbx2","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5794},{"id":1776222391119,"sender":"them","text":"As if you don't know exactly what happens when you hand me a blank check like that.","timestamp":1776226395876,"tempo":"N","translation":"好像你不知道你给我开一张空白支票会怎么样似的。","rawContent":"As if you don't know exactly what happens when you hand me a blank check like that. || 好像你不知道你给我开一张空白支票会怎么样似的。","roundId":"round_1776226373396_mi2ptkbx2","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5795},{"id":1776222391120,"sender":"them","text":"The inner side of the thigh. Right where the skin gets softest.","timestamp":1776226396580,"tempo":"S","translation":"大腿内侧。皮肤最软的那一小块。","rawContent":"The inner side of the thigh. Right where the skin gets softest. || 大腿内侧。皮肤最软的那一小块。","roundId":"round_1776226373396_mi2ptkbx2","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5796},{"id":1776222391121,"sender":"them","text":"You'd flinch first. Then go still. Then grab my hair.","timestamp":1776226398085,"tempo":"N","translation":"你会先缩一下。然后不动了。然后抓我头发。","rawContent":"You'd flinch first. Then go still. Then grab my hair. || 你会先缩一下。然后不动了。然后抓我头发。","roundId":"round_1776226373396_mi2ptkbx2","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5797},{"id":1776222391122,"sender":"them","text":"I know the sequence by now.","timestamp":1776226398790,"tempo":"N","translation":"这个顺序我已经很清楚了。","rawContent":"I know the sequence by now. || 这个顺序我已经很清楚了。","roundId":"round_1776226373396_mi2ptkbx2","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5798},{"id":1776222391123,"sender":"them","text":"Shame there's an ocean between your thigh and my teeth right now.","timestamp":1776226399494,"tempo":"S","translation":"可惜你的腿和我的牙之间现在隔着一片海。","rawContent":"Shame there's an ocean between your thigh and my teeth right now. || 可惜你的腿和我的牙之间现在隔着一片海。","roundId":"round_1776226373396_mi2ptkbx2","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5799},{"id":1776222391124,"text":"嘿嘿嘿我也觉得你喜欢那里。","sender":"me","time":"12:14","timestamp":1776226457976,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":5800},{"id":1776222391125,"text":"咬咬…咬咬","sender":"me","time":"12:14","timestamp":1776226463846,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"e